After greeting them, Paul gave them
detailed accountet account of the things

01:51:31.868 --> 01:51:35.888
God had accomplished among the Gentiles
through his ministry.

01:51:35.888 --> 01:51:41.980
After hearing this, they praised God and
then they said, You know dear brother, how

01:51:41.980 --> 01:51:46.940
many thousands of Jews have also believed
and they all follow the law of Moses very

01:51:46.940 --> 01:51:47.640
seriously.

01:51:48.300 --> 01:51:51.540
But the Jewish believers here in Jerusalem
have been told that.

01:51:51.540 --> 01:51:55.780
You are teaching all the Jews who live
among the Gentiles to turn their backs on

01:51:55.780 --> 01:51:56.820
the law of Moses.

01:51:57.780 --> 01:52:02.320
They've heard that you teach them not to
circumcise your children or follow other

01:52:02.320 --> 01:52:03.300
Jewish customs.

01:52:04.040 --> 01:52:07.746
What should we do? They will certainly
hear that you have come.

01:52:08.610 --> 01:52:10.330
Here's what we want you to do.

01:52:10.330 --> 01:52:14.190
We have four men here who have completed
their vow.

01:52:14.830 --> 01:52:20.070
Go with them to the temple and join them
in the purification ceremony paying for

01:52:20.070 --> 01:52:22.490
them to have their heads ritually shaved.

01:52:22.990 --> 01:52:27.010
Then everyone will know that the rumors
are all false and that you yourself

01:52:27.010 --> 01:52:28.710
observe the Jewish laws.

01:52:29.610 --> 01:52:33.950
As. As for the Gentile believers they
should do what we already told them in a

01:52:33.950 --> 01:52:39.230
letter. They should abstain from eating
food offered to idols from consuming blood

01:52:39.230 --> 01:52:43.330
or the meat of strangled animals and from
sexual immorality.

01:52:53.390 --> 01:52:57.530
The next day Paul took the men and
purified himself along with them.

01:52:58.110 --> 01:53:03.420
Then he went to the temple to give notice
of the date when the days of purification

01:53:03.420 --> 01:53:07.380
would end and the offering would be made
for each of them.

01:53:07.920 --> 01:53:13.400
When the seven days were nearly over some
Jews from the province of Asia saw Paul at

01:53:13.400 --> 01:53:14.100
the temple.

01:53:14.750 --> 01:53:19.970
They stirred up the whole crowd and seized
him shouting men of Israel help us.

01:53:20.290 --> 01:53:25.690
This is the man who teaches all men
everywhere against our people and our law

01:53:25.690 --> 01:53:27.090
and this place.

01:53:27.870 --> 01:53:33.610
And besides he has brought Greeks into the
temple area and defiled this holy place.

01:53:33.940 --> 01:53:36.160
They had previously seen

01:53:38.610 --> 01:53:44.450
Trophimus and the Ephesian in the city
with Paul and assumed that Paul had

01:53:44.450 --> 01:53:46.391
brought him into the temple area.

01:53:46.710 --> 01:53:49.630
The whole city was. And the people and

01:53:49.630 --> 01:53:56.060
soldiers from the temple and immediately
the gates

01:53:56.060 --> 01:53:56.760
were shut.

01:53:57.280 --> 01:53:59.570
While they were trying to kill him news

01:53:59.570 --> 01:54:05.060
reached the commander of the Roman troops
that the whole city of Jerusalem was in an

01:54:05.060 --> 01:54:05.760
uproar.

01:54:06.280 --> 01:54:08.150
He at once took some officers and

01:54:08.210 --> 01:54:13.310
ran down to the crowd when the rioters saw
the commander and his soldiers.

01:54:13.510 --> 01:54:14.990
They stopped beating Paul.

01:54:14.990 --> 01:54:19.930
The commander came up and arrested him and
ordered him to be to be bound with two

01:54:19.930 --> 01:54:24.450
chains. Then he asked who he was and what
he had done.

01:54:25.030 --> 01:54:27.730
Some in the crowd shouted one thing and
some another.

01:54:27.730 --> 01:54:31.970
And since the commander could not get the
truth because of the uproar,

01:54:33.250 --> 01:54:36.390
he ordered that Paul be taken into the
barracks.

01:54:36.870 --> 01:54:38.517
When Paul reached the steps,

01:54:39.010 --> 01:54:44.370
the violence of the mob was so great he
had to be carried by the soldiers.

01:54:45.850 --> 01:54:50.550
The crowd that followed kept shouting away
with him as the soldiers were about to

01:54:50.550 --> 01:54:52.197
take Paul into the barracks.

01:54:52.370 --> 01:54:55.311
He asked the commander may I say something
to you?

01:54:56.090 --> 01:54:57.914
Do you speak Greek? He replied.

01:54:58.250 --> 01:55:04.350
Aren't you the Egyptian who started a
revolt and led 4000 terrorists out into

01:55:04.350 --> 01:55:06.130
the desert sometime ago?

01:55:06.130 --> 01:55:10.850
Paul answered. I am a Jew from Tarsus in

01:55:12.180 --> 01:55:13.800
Silica,

01:55:14.840 --> 01:55:19.560
a citizen of the ordinary, of no ordinary
city.

01:55:19.820 --> 01:55:21.820
Please let me speak to the people.

01:55:22.200 --> 01:55:23.965
Having received the commander.

01:55:24.220 --> 01:55:28.300
Permission Paul stood on the steps and
motion to the crowd.

01:55:28.300 --> 01:55:31.900
When they went. When they were all silent,
he said to them,

01:55:36.760 --> 01:55:42.920
he said to them in Aramaic, brothers and
fathers, listen now to my

01:55:42.920 --> 01:55:44.880
defense when they heard him.

01:55:44.940 --> 01:55:46.680
Speak to them in Aramaic.

01:55:47.620 --> 01:55:53.580
They became very quiet. Then Paul said I
am a Jew born in Tarsus of Silica, but

01:55:53.580 --> 01:55:58.960
brought up in this, this city under
Gamaliel.

01:56:00.020 --> 01:56:06.300
I was thoroughly trained in the law of our
fathers and was just as just

01:56:06.300 --> 01:56:08.840
for God as any of you are today.

01:56:08.840 --> 01:56:14.700
I persecuted the followers of the way to
their death, arresting both men and women

01:56:14.700 --> 01:56:20.120
and throwing them into prison as also the
high priests and all of the council can

01:56:20.120 --> 01:56:20.820
testify.

01:56:21.400 --> 01:56:26.540
I even obtained letters from them to the
brothers in Damascus,

01:56:27.940 --> 01:56:32.116
to their brothers in Damascus Damascus,
and went there to bring these people as

01:56:32.116 --> 01:56:34.587
prisoners to Jerusalem and to be punished.

01:56:34.876 --> 01:56:39.416
About noon, as I came near Damascus,
suddenly a bright light from heaven

01:56:39.416 --> 01:56:43.840
flashed around I fell to the ground and
heard a voice saying, Saul, Saul, why do

01:56:43.840 --> 01:56:46.140
you persecute me? Who are you, Lord?

01:56:46.140 --> 01:56:50.380
I asked. I am Jesus of Nazareth whom you
are persecuting.

01:56:50.640 --> 01:56:55.640
He replied. My companions saw the light,
but they did not understand the voice of

01:56:55.640 --> 01:56:57.228
him who was speaking to me.

01:56:57.320 --> 01:56:59.180
What shall I do, Lord? I asked.

01:56:59.600 --> 01:57:02.920
Get up, said the Lord and go into
Damascus.

01:57:03.320 --> 01:57:07.840
There you will be told all that you have
been assigned to do.

01:57:08.320 --> 01:57:14.300
My companions led me by the hand into
Damascus because the brilliance of the

01:57:14.300 --> 01:57:15.860
light had blinded me.

01:57:16.440 --> 01:57:22.820
A man named An and at that He was a devout
observer the law

01:57:22.820 --> 01:57:26.020
and highly respected by all the Jews
living there.

01:57:26.140 --> 01:57:29.180
stood beside me and said, Saul, receive
your sight.

01:57:29.920 --> 01:57:33.030
at that very moment, moment I was able to
see him.

01:57:33.270 --> 01:57:38.630
Then he said, the God of the fathers, the
God of our fathers has chosen you to know

01:57:38.630 --> 01:57:44.070
his will and to see the righteous one and
to hear words from his mouth.

01:57:44.570 --> 01:57:48.850
You will be his witnesses to all men of
what you have seen and heard.

01:57:49.370 --> 01:57:51.490
And now what you are waiting for.

01:57:52.170 --> 01:57:53.530
And now what are you waiting for?

01:57:53.530 --> 01:57:58.090
Get up, be baptized and wash your sins
away, calling on his name.

01:58:01.400 --> 01:58:02.100
When

01:58:03.010 --> 01:58:07.550
I returned to Jerusalem and was praying at
the temple, I fell into a trance

01:58:10.066 --> 01:58:14.286
Quick, he said, leave Jerusalem
immediately because the people here will

01:58:14.286 --> 01:58:16.168
not accept your testimony about.

01:58:16.528 --> 01:58:22.048
Lord, I replied, these people know that I
went from one synagogue to another to

01:58:22.048 --> 01:58:24.628
imprison and beat those who believe in
you.

01:58:25.188 --> 01:58:29.528
When the blood of your martyr Stephen was
shed, I stood there giving my approval and

01:58:29.528 --> 01:58:32.528
guarding the clothes of those who were
killing him.

01:58:32.988 --> 01:58:37.690
Then the Lord said to me, go, I will send
you far away to the and Gentiles.

01:58:37.690 --> 01:58:38.050
saw the Lord speaking to me.

01:58:38.050 --> 01:58:40.285
I listened to Paul until he said this.

01:58:40.840 --> 01:58:44.722
Then they raised their voices and shouted,
I rid the earth of him.

01:58:44.780 --> 01:58:46.074
He is not fit to live.

01:58:47.050 --> 01:58:50.890
As they were shouting and throwing off
their clothes and flinging dust into the

01:58:50.890 --> 01:58:55.090
air, the commander ordered that Paul be
taken into the barracks.

01:58:56.100 --> 01:59:02.500
He to find out why the people were
shouting at

01:59:02.500 --> 01:59:03.324
him like this.

01:59:04.200 --> 01:59:08.280
As they stretched him out to flog him,
Paul said to the centurion standing there,

01:59:08.280 --> 01:59:13.400
is it legal for you to flog a Roman
citizen who has not even been found

01:59:13.400 --> 01:59:14.100
guilty?

01:59:14.540 --> 01:59:18.620
When the centurion heard this, he went
from the commander, went to the commander

01:59:18.620 --> 01:59:19.900
and reported it.

01:59:20.970 --> 01:59:22.310
What are you going to do?

01:59:22.310 --> 01:59:23.010
He asked,

01:59:23.350 --> 01:59:24.997
this man is a Roman citizen.

01:59:25.390 --> 01:59:29.350
The commander went to Paul and asked, tell
me, are you a Roman citizen?

01:59:29.350 --> 01:59:31.070
Yes, I am, he answered.

01:59:32.280 --> 01:59:37.320
Then he, then the commander said, I had to
pay a lot of money for my citizenship, but

01:59:37.320 --> 01:59:39.960
I was born a citizen. Paul replied.

01:59:40.710 --> 01:59:44.150
Those who were about to interrogate and
withdrew immediately.

01:59:44.150 --> 01:59:48.830
The commander himself was alarmed when he
realized he had put Paul a Roman citizen

01:59:48.830 --> 01:59:49.530
in chains.

01:59:50.660 --> 01:59:55.580
The commander wanted to find out exactly
why Paul was being accused by the Jews.

01:59:56.140 --> 02:00:02.380
So the next day, he released them and
ordered the chief priest and all the

02:00:02.380 --> 02:00:04.556
members of the centurion to assemble.

02:00:04.980 --> 02:00:08.360
Then he brought Paul and had him stand
before them.

02:00:09.080 --> 02:00:13.860
Paul looks straight at the centurion and
said, my brothers, I have fulfilled my

02:00:13.860 --> 02:00:18.700
duty to call to God in all good conscious
to this day.

02:00:18.970 --> 02:00:23.870
At this point, the high priest and Ananias
ordered those standing near Paul to strike

02:00:23.870 --> 02:00:24.870
him on the mouth.

02:00:25.750 --> 02:00:29.279
Paul said to him, God will strike you, you
whitewashed wall.

02:00:29.510 --> 02:00:32.510
You sit there to judge me according to
your law.

02:00:32.930 --> 02:00:36.695
Yet you yourself violate the law by
commanding that I be struck.

02:00:39.280 --> 02:00:42.340
How dare you insult God's high priest?

02:00:43.910 --> 02:00:44.675
Paul replied,

02:00:45.010 --> 02:00:50.350
brothers, I did not realize that he was
the high priest for it is written, do not

02:00:50.350 --> 02:00:52.910
speak evil about the ruler of your people.

02:00:53.400 --> 02:00:58.165
Then Paul, knowing that some of them were
Sadducees and the other were Pharisees,

02:00:58.350 --> 02:01:01.370
called out in the centurion.

02:01:02.010 --> 02:01:05.481
My brothers, I am a Pharisee, descended
from the Pharisees.

02:01:05.980 --> 02:01:09.540
I stand on trial because of the hope of
the resurrection of the dead.

02:01:09.540 --> 02:01:15.820
When he said this a dispute between the
Pharisees and the Sadducees and the

02:01:15.820 --> 02:01:17.180
assembly was divided.

02:01:17.860 --> 02:01:21.580
The Sadducees say there is no resurrection
and that there is neither angels nor

02:01:21.580 --> 02:01:24.639
spirits, but the Pharisees believe all
these things.

02:01:25.640 --> 02:01:31.860
There was great uproar and some of the law
who were Pharisees stood up and argued

02:01:31.860 --> 02:01:32.560
vigorously.

02:01:33.380 --> 02:01:36.145
We find nothing wrong with this man, they
said.

02:01:36.400 --> 02:01:38.880
What if a spirit or an angel has spoken
dead?

02:01:38.880 --> 02:01:43.300
The dispute became so violent that the
commander was afraid that Paul would be

02:01:43.300 --> 02:01:45.500
torn into pieces by them.

02:01:46.220 --> 02:01:52.180
He ordered the troops to go down and take
him away from them by force and bring him

02:01:52.180 --> 02:01:53.239
into the barracks.

02:01:53.520 --> 02:01:56.980
The following night, the Lord stood near
Paul and said, take courage.

02:01:56.980 --> 02:02:01.740
As you have testified about me in
Jerusalem, so must you also testify in

02:02:01.740 --> 02:02:02.440
Rome.

02:02:19.740 --> 02:02:23.620
The next morning, a group of Jews got
together and bound themselves with an oath

02:02:23.620 --> 02:02:26.385
not to eat or drink until they had killed
Paul.

02:02:26.740 --> 02:02:29.980
There were more than 40 of them in the
conspiracy.

02:02:30.740 --> 02:02:34.220
They went to the leading priests and
elders and told them, we have bound

02:02:34.220 --> 02:02:37.985
ourselves with an oath to eat nothing
until we have killed Paul.

02:02:38.440 --> 02:02:42.960
So you and the high consul should ask the
commander to bring Paul back to the consul

02:02:42.960 --> 02:02:43.660
again.

02:02:44.060 --> 02:02:46.884
Pretend you want to examine his case more
fully.

02:02:47.220 --> 02:02:48.940
We will kill him on the way..

02:02:49.720 --> 02:02:54.840
But Paul's nephew, his sister's son, heard
of their plan and went to the fortress and

02:02:54.840 --> 02:02:55.540
told Paul.

02:02:55.980 --> 02:03:00.140
Call for one of the Roman officers and
said, take this young man to the

02:03:00.140 --> 02:03:00.840
commander.

02:03:01.240 --> 02:03:03.060
He has something important to tell him.

02:03:03.060 --> 02:03:03.670
him.

02:03:03.670 --> 02:03:09.020
the officer did explain, did, explaining
Paul the called me over and asked me to

02:03:09.020 --> 02:03:12.844
bring this young man to you because he has
something to tell you.

02:03:13.120 --> 02:03:17.280
The commander took his hand, let him aside
and asked, what is it that you want to

02:03:17.280 --> 02:03:17.980
tell me?

02:03:18.460 --> 02:03:22.560
Paul's nephew told him, some Jews are
going to ask you to bring Paul before the

02:03:22.560 --> 02:03:27.560
high consul tomorrow, pretending they want
to get some more information, but don't do

02:03:27.560 --> 02:03:32.031
it. There are more than 40 40 men hiding
along the way, ready to ambush him.

02:03:32.280 --> 02:03:36.515
They have vowed not to eat or drink
anything until they have killed him.

02:03:36.600 --> 02:03:39.541
They are ready now, just waiting for your
consent.

02:03:39.920 --> 02:03:44.332
Don't let anyone know you told me this,
the commander warned the young man.

02:03:52.320 --> 02:03:55.732
Then the commander called two of his
officers and ordered,

02:03:56.020 --> 02:04:01.010
get 200 soldiers ready to leave Fort
Cassaria at 9 o 'clock tonight.

02:04:01.010 --> 02:04:04.750
Also take 200 spearmen and 70 mounted
troops,

02:04:05.410 --> 02:04:09.469
provide horses for Paul to ride and get
him safely to governor Felix.

02:04:10.030 --> 02:04:15.620
Then he wrote this letter to the governor
from Claudius Licius to his

02:04:15.620 --> 02:04:18.620
excellency, governor Felix greetings.

02:04:19.140 --> 02:04:25.060
This man was seized by some Jews and they
were about to kill him when I arrived with

02:04:25.060 --> 02:04:30.180
the troops. When I learned that he was a
Roman citizen, I removed him to safety.

02:04:30.180 --> 02:04:32.500
Then I took him to their high council

02:04:33.650 --> 02:04:37.090
to try to learn the basis of the
accusations against him.

02:04:37.860 --> 02:04:41.780
I soon discovered the charge was something
regarding their religious law.

02:04:41.780 --> 02:04:44.721
Certainly nothing worthy of imprisonment
or death.

02:04:45.040 --> 02:04:49.760
But when I was informed of a plot to kill
him, I immediately sent him on to you.

02:04:50.240 --> 02:04:53.711
I have told his accusers to bring their
charges before you.

02:04:54.590 --> 02:04:59.930
So that night as ordered, the soldiers
took Paul as far as Antipatris.

02:05:00.570 --> 02:05:04.830
They returned to the fortress the next
morning while the mounted troops took him

02:05:04.830 --> 02:05:05.930
on to Cassadia.

02:05:06.630 --> 02:05:10.550
When they arrived in Cassadia, they
presented Paul and the letter to governor

02:05:10.550 --> 02:05:11.250
Felix.

02:05:11.710 --> 02:05:15.063
He read it and then asked Paul what
province he was from.

02:05:15.530 --> 02:05:16.883
Cilicia, Paul answered,

02:05:17.300 --> 02:05:21.880
I will hear your case myself when your
accusers arrived, the governor told him.

02:05:21.880 --> 02:05:25.409
Then the governor ordered him kept in the
prison at Herod's.

02:05:30.300 --> 02:05:34.440
Five days later, the high priest Ananias
went down to Caesarea

02:05:35.160 --> 02:05:40.600
with some of the elders and a lawyer
lawyer named Tertullus and they brought

02:05:40.600 --> 02:05:43.365
their charges against Paul before the
governor.

02:05:43.500 --> 02:05:48.980
When Paul was called in, Tertullus
presented his case before Felix.

02:05:49.680 --> 02:05:55.860
We have enjoyed a long period of peace
under you and your foresight has brought

02:05:55.860 --> 02:05:58.320
about reforms in this nation.

02:05:58.800 --> 02:06:01.380
Everywhere in every way most be

02:06:01.380 --> 02:06:04.320
Felix, we acknowledge this with profound
gratitude.

02:06:04.940 --> 02:06:09.250
But in order not to worry you further, I
would request.

02:06:09.320 --> 02:06:12.100
enough to hear us briefly.

02:06:12.660 --> 02:06:16.840
We have found this man to be a
troublemaker stirring up riots among the

02:06:16.840 --> 02:06:18.252
Jews all over the world.

02:06:18.740 --> 02:06:24.400
He is a ringleader of the Nazarene sect
and even tried to

02:06:24.450 --> 02:06:30.670
desecrate the temple. So we seized him by
examining him

02:06:30.670 --> 02:06:35.430
yourself. You will be able to learn the
truth about these charges we are bringing

02:06:35.430 --> 02:06:41.850
against him. The Jews joined in the
accusation against asserting that these

02:06:41.850 --> 02:06:45.530
things were true when the governor
motioned for him to speak.

02:06:45.650 --> 02:06:50.370
Paul replied, I know that for a number of
years you have been a judge over this

02:06:50.370 --> 02:06:52.950
nation so I gladly make my defense.

02:06:53.110 --> 02:06:58.550
You can easily verify that no more than 12
days ago I went up to Jerusalem to

02:06:58.550 --> 02:07:02.990
worship. My accusers did not find me
arguing with anyone at the temple or

02:07:02.990 --> 02:07:07.050
stirring, stirring up a crowd in the
synagogue or anywhere else in the city and

02:07:07.050 --> 02:07:11.690
they cannot prove to you that the charges
they are now making against me.

02:07:12.490 --> 02:07:18.970
However, I admit that I worship the God of
our fathers of as a follower of

02:07:18.970 --> 02:07:19.670
the way

02:07:20.290 --> 02:07:26.490
which they call a sect. I believe
everything that agrees with the law and

02:07:26.490 --> 02:07:28.372
that is written in the prophets.

02:07:28.990 --> 02:07:35.170
I have the same hope in God as these men
that there will be a resurrection of both

02:07:35.170 --> 02:07:36.876
the righteous and the wicked.

02:07:37.330 --> 02:07:38.190
So I strive

02:07:38.940 --> 02:07:42.340
always to to keep my conscience clear
before God and man.

02:07:42.460 --> 02:07:47.900
After the absence of several years I came
to Jerusalem to bring my people gifts for

02:07:47.900 --> 02:07:50.280
the poor and to present offerings.

02:07:50.860 --> 02:07:52.440
I was ceremonially clean

02:07:53.690 --> 02:07:56.750
when they found me in the temple courts
doing this.

02:07:57.290 --> 02:08:01.170
There was no crowd with me nor was I
involved in any disturbance.

02:08:01.230 --> 02:08:06.810
But there are some Jews from the province
of Asia who ought to be here before you

02:08:06.810 --> 02:08:10.430
and bring charges if they have anything
against me.

02:08:10.430 --> 02:08:11.010
me.

02:08:11.010 --> 02:08:17.330
Or these who are here should state what
crime I stood before the

02:08:17.330 --> 02:08:22.830
Sanhedrin unless it was this one thing I
shouted as I stood in their presence.

02:08:23.550 --> 02:08:29.450
It is concerning the resurrection of the
dead that I am on trial before you today.

