02:33:34.400 --> 02:33:38.340
Three days. Days after Paul's arrival, he
called together the local Jewish leaders.

02:33:38.340 --> 02:33:39.869
He said to them, brothers,

02:33:39.960 --> 02:33:43.700
I was arrested in Jerusalem and handed
over to the Roman government even though I

02:33:43.700 --> 02:33:47.700
had done nothing against our people or the
customs of our ancestors.

02:33:48.350 --> 02:33:54.810
The Romans tried me and wanted to release
me, because they found

02:33:54.950 --> 02:33:56.832
no cause for the death sentence.

02:33:57.250 --> 02:34:00.450
But when the Jewish leaders protested the,
decision I felt it necessary.

02:34:00.450 --> 02:34:04.730
to appeal to Caesar, even though I had no
desire to press charges against my own

02:34:04.730 --> 02:34:05.430
