against you from anyone who has come here.

02:34:26.810 --> 02:34:31.270
But we want to hear what you believe, for
the only thing we know about this movement

02:34:31.270 --> 02:34:33.470
is that it is denounced everywhere.

02:34:36.000 --> 02:34:37.440
So a time was set

02:34:38.560 --> 02:34:42.384
