what I say, you will not understand.

02:35:16.720 --> 02:35:19.544
When you see what I do, you will not
comprehend.

02:35:20.360 --> 02:35:23.440
For the hearts. These people are hardened
and their ears cannot hear and they have

02:35:23.440 --> 02:35:26.980
closed their eyes, cannot see their ears,
cannot hear in their cars, cannot

02:35:26.980 --> 02:35:30.700
understand, And they cannot turn to me and
